node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Crystallophone Glass Harmonica Synth. Bowed nested glass bowl harmonica synthesizer with modal overtone partials, rotational vibrato shimmer, and velocity-coupled harmonic bloom.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
cable out 0 pic
